            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muted country"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "preferences.countries.emptyList": {
      "comment": "Shown when no country is muted.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا توجد دول مكتومة."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No countries muted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "preferences.countries.explanation": {
      "comment": "What muting a country does, and why it cannot be faked — it matches the verified badge, not an IP address.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يخفي منشورات الحسابات التي تكون دولتها الموثّقة إحدى هذه الدول — من الصفحة الدولية، سواء كانت تصفية المواضيع مفعّلة أم لا. ويعتمد على شارة الدولة الموثّقة، لذلك لا يمكن تزييفه بشبكة افتراضية."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hides posts by accounts whose verified country is one of these — from the International feed, whether or not the topic filter is on. It matches the verified country badge, so it cannot be faked with a VPN."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "preferences.countries.field.hint": {
      "comment": "VoiceOver hint for the country-code field. The spaced letters are read out one by one.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "رمز الدولة من حرفين بمعيار آيزو، مثل S A للسعودية"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two-letter ISO country code, such as S A for Saudi Arabia"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "preferences.countries.field.label": {
      "comment": "Label above the country-code field.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "رمز الدولة"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Country code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "preferences.country.displayName": {
