            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sends this to a Sila reviewer. %@ is not told."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "safety.support.call.a11yLabel": {
      "comment": "VoiceOver label for a support resource's phone link. %1$@ is the resource's name, %2$@ the number.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "اتصل بـ%1$@ على %2$@"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Call %1$@ on %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "safety.support.fallbackMessage": {
      "comment": "The care-first message when the server supplied none. Contains NO phone number on purpose: this client does not know what country the person is in, and a helpline invented on the device is a wrong number handed to somebody in an emergency.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يطّلع مراجعو سِلة على بلاغات إيذاء النفس أولًا.\n\nإن كنت ترى أن شخصًا في خطر مباشر، فاتصل بخدمات الطوارئ في بلدك الآن — لا تستطيع سِلة الاتصال بأحد نيابةً عنك.\n\nوإن كنت أنت من يمر بضيق، فأخبر شخصًا تثق به اليوم."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sila's reviewers look at self-harm reports first.\n\nIf you think someone is in immediate danger, contact your local emergency services now — Sila cannot call anyone on your behalf.\n\nIf it is you who is struggling, please tell somebody you trust today."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "safety.support.nextSteps": {
      "comment": "Offered rather than pushed. Somebody reporting self-harm is usually trying to help a person, not remove them.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لست مضطرًا إلى إيقاف متابعته أو رؤيته. وإن كنت تفضّل الابتعاد قليلًا الآن، فالكتم صامت ويمكن التراجع عنه."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You do not have to stop following or seeing them. If you would rather step back for now, muting is silent and reversible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "safety.support.open": {
      "comment": "Link that opens a support resource's website.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "فتح"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "safety.support.open.a11yLabel": {
      "comment": "VoiceOver label for a support resource's link. %@ is the resource's name.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "فتح %@"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "safety.support.privacy": {
      "comment": "The reassurance under the care-first outcome.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "الشخص الذي أبلغت عنه لا يُبلَّغ بأنك أبلغت عنه."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The person you reported is not told that you reported them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "safety.support.title": {
      "comment": "Heading on the care-first outcome, shown for a self-harm report.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "شكرًا لإخبارنا"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thank you for telling us"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "safety.suspended.badge": {
      "comment": "Badge on the suspension screen.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "موقوف"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suspended"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "safety.suspended.checkAgain": {
      "comment": "Button that re-reads the suspension from the server.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تحقّق مجددًا"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "safety.suspended.checkAgain.hint": {
      "comment": "VoiceOver hint for the check-again button.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يعيد قراءة حالة إيقافك من سِلة"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Re-reads your suspension from Sila"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "safety.suspended.indefinite": {
      "comment": "What an indefinite suspension means, said plainly rather than left blank.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا يوجد تاريخ انتهاء لهذا الإيقاف. ولا ينتهي من تلقاء نفسه — والتظلّم هو الشيء الوحيد الذي يغيّره."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This suspension has no end date. It does not expire on its own — an appeal is the only thing that changes it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "safety.suspended.liftsOn": {
      "comment": "When a fixed-term suspension ends. %@ is the date.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يُرفع هذا الإيقاف في %@."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This suspension lifts on %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "safety.suspended.noReason": {
      "comment": "Said when the server gave no reason. It does not invent one.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لم تُرفق سِلة سببًا بهذا الإيقاف. والتظلّم أدناه يصل إلى إنسان يمكنه الاطلاع على السجل كاملًا."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sila did not attach a reason to this suspension. The appeal below reaches a human who can see the full record."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "safety.suspended.noReasonHeader": {
      "comment": "Header shown when the server attached no reason. Upper case in English by design.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لم يُذكر سبب"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NO REASON GIVEN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "safety.suspended.rightNowHeader": {
      "comment": "Header above the description of the current state.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "في الوقت الحالي"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Right now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "safety.suspended.scope": {
      "comment": "What is and is not reachable while suspended.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا شيء آخر في سِلة يعمل ما دام هذا قائمًا. منشوراتك مخفية، وهذه الشاشة والتظلّم هما الشيئان الوحيدان اللذان يمكنك الوصول إليهما."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing else on Sila works while this is in place. Your posts are hidden, and this screen and the appeal are the only things you can reach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "safety.suspended.signOut.note": {
      "comment": "Says signing out changes nothing about the suspension.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تسجيل الخروج لا يغيّر شيئًا في الإيقاف. سيظل قائمًا عندما تعود وتسجّل الدخول."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Signing out changes nothing about the suspension. It will still be here when you sign back in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "safety.suspended.title": {
      "comment": "Heading on the suspension screen.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "حسابك موقوف"
          }
